---
description: DOM chrome must use the shared UI kit
globs: src/ui/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI kit

Non-3D controls come from `src/ui/kit` (`createButton`, `createTabList`, `createRangeField`, `createToggle`, `createListRow`, `createConfirmDialog`, …).

- Styles: edit one partial — `buttons.css` / `shell.css` / `forms.css` (`kit.css` only re-exports)
- Tokens live in `src/style.css` `:root`
- Do not hand-roll new `glass-btn` / `glass-pill` CSS in screen modules
- Screen `*.module.css` files own layout only
